---
import { ArrowRight } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="rounded-card bg-petroleo px-6 py-10 text-white sm:px-10 sm:py-12">
  <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-jade brightness-150">COLABOREMOS</p>
  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col justify-between gap-7 lg:flex-row lg:items-end">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">¿Construimos algo juntos?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-white/75">¿Representas una comunidad, institución, evento o empresa? Conversemos sobre cómo podemos colaborar.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/contacto?tipo=colaboracion" class="inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 self-start rounded-full bg-jade px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-petroleo focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white sm:w-auto lg:self-auto">Proponer una colaboración <ArrowRight class="h-4 w-4" /></a>
  </div>
</section>
